HOW TO READ A PLANT (docs/queue-2026-11-06b.md rule 15)
  A plant is a fault I introduce in the subject. CAUGHT means at least one test
  or check turns red because of it; that is the good outcome. MISSED means every
  test stayed green; that is a finding. The plants below are mine, not the
  author's.

