  So the new test is load-bearing, but for the diagnosis text: the pre-A3.11
  code already refused this manifest, through the key-fingerprint check. The new
  guard is defence in depth for a manifest that would pass verify_manifest and
  then reach manifest["release"].
  Verdict on A3.11 for this file: stronger. The test fails on the old code and
  passes on the new one.

